      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FINALLY FRIDAY (1) comes off a moderate effort last start, finishing fourth at this track over 390m behind Glint (22.44). Solid formlines coming through his last run. Better than last start and worth following up. HELLO SYDNEY (8) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (22.88) in a Bottom Up - Maiden at Warrnambool latest but did run well two back when in the frame. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. PAW NINA (7) shows ability but remains a maiden after seven starts. Continues to race well without winning, finishing in the money at the last three runs. Likely to be in the finish again. RAKAIA (4) is right in the mix.",
